notes=['# Form Finding review comments — 25 September 2026','','18 records addressed, including four duplicates: 14 distinct issues. Six canonical chapters revised, one existing forge promoted, one artifact normal fix and three unmodified native museum photographs.','','## Findings','','The forge now joins the puzzle and optimiser as a third primary encounter. Its clock-driven gathering is a counterexample: a destination can be authored even when the journey looks like emergence. The other Descent works retain supporting roles; brief passages provide comparisons without displacing the controlled experiment.','','The current glowing well computes a loss for its first marble. The review’s portrait-only description is outdated. Companion tutorials were read as earlier material; some claims exceed current implementation. They are preserved, not treated as proof of present behaviour.','','Normals alone changed in the native well meshes. Vertex/index hashes, bounds and transforms match; materials, depths, receiver dynamics and interpretation controls remain. The new photograph uses a camera 1.7 m above the artifact floor datum at the outside edge in the actual museum.','','The cloth uses real buttons then controlled production steps: WIND off, 60 pre-steps and 360 fixed updates. Mean/worst errors: one pass 1.4089407% / 34.2761152%; four passes 0.3591769% / 8.9355163%. The vessel’s two-sided FrozenSkin answers a collision ray; this does not test tracked-hand or headset traversal.','','## Evidence and limits','','51 final native checks pass across four loaded halls: wells 12, relaxation 17, forge 10, descent 12. All processes exit 0, no GDScript errors. The 12-check well baseline and first 8-check forge camera run are retained. The closer forge photograph avoids a neighbouring sculpture without changing the room. Supplied phases and paused processing are capture conditions, not live headset observation.','','Logs retain an existing unrecognised UID error, registry and GL compatibility warnings, and artifact build-time warnings. Relaxation reports an ObjectDB leak at exit. These are not clean engine runs or Quest performance acceptance. No live museum bake/save was replaced. Reload the hall for the normals change.','','Canonical chapters and the current six-hall capture are refreshed. All six map placements, sequence order, wall-card book JSON and companion manuscripts remain. Shared core/role writes preserve other halls. No git commit or external publication.','','## Decisions','']
for t in q['tasks']:
 d=D[t['id']];notes += [f"### {t['id']} — {t['title']}",'',d['decision'],''];rows.append('<tr><td>'+html.escape(t['id']+' · '+t['title'])+'</td><td>'+html.escape(d['decision'])+'</td></tr>')
